      "summary": "State Representative Valerie Gaydos attended a community event in Leetsdale Borough to watch the historic Union Pacific Big Boy No. 4014 steam locomotive pass through. At the event, she presented a formal citation from the Pennsylvania House of Representatives honoring the borough for hosting the stop. The release is primarily a media advisory announcing the event's logistics.",
